      "id": "copilot-1790311192774-0",
      "provider": "copilot",
      "providerName": "Microsoft Copilot",
      "providerColor": "#0078D4",
      "date": "2026-09-25",
      "text": "This page lists the latest features and improvements for Microsoft 365 Copilot. It includes changes that are generally available (Current Channel for Microsoft 365 apps) and specific to each platform.",
      "severity": "info",
      "severityLabel": "Info",
      "source": "https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/copilot/microsoft-365/release-notes"
    },
    {
      "id": "copilot-1790311192774-1",
      "provider": "copilot",
      "providerName": "Microsoft Copilot",
      "providerColor": "#0078D4",
      "date": "2026-09-25",
      "text": "Copilot features are introduced using a safe deployment model, gradually rolling out to a subset of users within a tenant before expanding across the organization.",
      "severity": "info",
      "severityLabel": "Info",
      "source": "https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/copilot/microsoft-365/release-notes"
    },
    {
      "id": "copilot-1790311192774-2",
      "provider": "copilot",
      "providerName": "Microsoft Copilot",
      "providerColor": "#0078D4",
      "date": "2026-09-25",
      "text": "Navigate to your workbook changes directly from the Copilot chat pane response [Windows, Web, Mac]",
      "severity": "medium",
      "severityLabel": "Cambio comportamento",
      "source": "https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/copilot/microsoft-365/release-notes"
    },
    {
      "id": "copilot-1790311192774-3",
      "provider": "copilot",
      "providerName": "Microsoft Copilot",
      "providerColor": "#0078D4",
      "date": "2026-09-25",
      "text": "In Copilot in Excel, the response contains links to highlight where changes are made in your workbook. Navigate directly to new sheets, tables, ranges, and objects like charts and shapes.",
      "severity": "medium",
      "severityLabel": "Cambio comportamento",
      "source": "https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/copilot/microsoft-365/release-notes"
    },
    {
      "id": "copilot-1790311192774-4",
      "provider": "copilot",
      "providerName": "Microsoft Copilot",
      "providerColor": "#0078D4",
      "date": "2026-09-25",
      "text": "What changed: In the Copilot chat response, there now is a link you can click that will take you directly to changes in the workbook. Previously, you would need to locate the change in the response and navigate in the sheet on your own.",
      "severity": "medium",
      "severityLabel": "Cambio comportamento",
      "source": "https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/copilot/microsoft-365/release-notes"
    },
    {
      "id": "copilot-1790311192774-5",
      "provider": "copilot",
      "providerName": "Microsoft Copilot",
      "providerColor": "#0078D4",
      "date": "2026-09-25",
      "text": "Why: We want you to understand where copilot made edits and connect you to them directly from the chat response. This will help build confidence in the changes and allow you to review while you're reading the response in the chat pane.",
      "severity": "medium",
      "severityLabel": "Cambio comportamento",
      "source": "https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/copilot/microsoft-365/release-notes"
    },
    {
      "id": "copilot-1790311192774-6",
      "provider": "copilot",
      "providerName": "Microsoft Copilot",
      "providerColor": "#0078D4",
      "date": "2026-09-25",
      "text": "Send a prompt to Copilot where the workbook is modified.",
      "severity": "medium",
      "severityLabel": "Cambio comportamento",
      "source": "https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/copilot/microsoft-365/release-notes"
    },
    {
      "id": "copilot-1790311192774-7",
      "provider": "copilot",
      "providerName": "Microsoft Copilot",
      "providerColor": "#0078D4",
      "date": "2026-09-25",
      "text": "The chat response will show the changes in a different format with a highlight to indicate a link you can click for navigation. New Sheets, tables, ranges, and objects will be highlighted.",
      "severity": "medium",
      "severityLabel": "Cambio comportamento",
      "source": "https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/copilot/microsoft-365/release-notes"
    },
    {
      "id": "copilot-1790311192774-8",
      "provider": "copilot",
      "providerName": "Microsoft Copilot",
      "providerColor": "#0078D4",
      "date": "2026-09-25",
      "text": "Why this matters: The feature allows quick review of document changes made by Copilot, increasing transparency of the edits.",
      "severity": "info",
      "severityLabel": "Info",
      "source": "https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/copilot/microsoft-365/release-notes"
    },
    {
      "id": "copilot-1790311192775-9",
      "provider": "copilot",
      "providerName": "Microsoft Copilot",
      "providerColor": "#0078D4",
      "date": "2026-09-25",
      "text": "Business impact: Teams can understand changes made while reading the response from Copilot and quickly navigate to those places for review.",
      "severity": "medium",
      "severityLabel": "Cambio comportamento",
      "source": "https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/copilot/microsoft-365/release-notes"
